# Code ownership for hidden-tokens/.github
#
# Code ownership routes to @tokenimizer (org member). Admin/owner actions
# (rulesets, settings) remain with the org owner.
# Ownership is NOT inherited by other org repositories — each repository
# that wants review routing carries its own CODEOWNERS file.

# Global fallback — everything in this repository.
* @tokenimizer

# Review expectations (documented, not enforced by GitHub):
# - Every change lands as a PR into `develop`; direct pushes to `main` are
#   never made.
# - Code owners are requested for review on every PR; the PR
#   trail, not the approval ceremony, is the review of record.
# - Workflow changes additionally require a green `Workflow validation` run.
